l Goods and Services Tax (Second Amendment) Rules 2025","issuedOn":null,"pdfUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-04/gst-ct-11-2025.pdf","pdfUrlHindi":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-04/gst-ct-11h-2025.pdf","listingUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/cgst-tax-notification","sortDate":"2025-04-01","firstSeenOn":"2026-11-13","status":"failed"},{"id":"27581a5f526ef2c00dfc","sourceId":"gstc-cgst-tax-notification","authority":"GST Council","category":"CGST Notification","topics":["gst"],"number":"10/2025-Central Tax","title":"Seeks to amend notification No. 02/2017-Central Tax.","issuedOn":null,"pdfUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-04/gst-ct-10-2025.pdf","pdfUrlHindi":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-04/gst-ct-10h-2025.pdf","listingUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/cgst-tax-notification","sortDate":"2025-04-01","firstSeenOn":"2026-11-13","status":"failed"},{"id":"04763963363c2aeda7dd","sourceId":"gstc-cgst-tax-notification","authority":"GST Council","category":"CGST Notification","topics":["gst"],"number":"09/2025-Central Tax","title":"Seeks to bring rules 2, 8, 24, 27, 32, 37, 38 of the CGST (Amendment) Rules, 2024 in to force","issuedOn":null,"pdfUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-04/09-2025-ct-eng.pdf","pdfUrlHindi":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-04/09-2025-ct-hin.pdf","listingUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/cgst-tax-notification","sortDate":"2025-04-01","firstSeenOn":"2026-11-13","status":"ready","plainTitle":"Effective Dates Announced for CGST Amendment Rules 2024","summaryEn":["The government has announced the rollout dates for certain CGST (Amendment) Rules, 2024.","Rules 2, 24, 27, and 32 come into effect immediately from 11th February, 2025.","Rules 8, 37, and clause (ii) of rule 38 will come into effect from 1st April, 2025.","Businesses and tax advisors should review these specific rule updates to ensure timely compliance."],"summaryHi":["सरकार ने सीजीएसटी (संशोधन) नियम, 2024 के कुछ नियमों के लागू होने की तारीखें घोषित कर दी हैं।","नियम 2, 24, 27 और 32 तुरंत प्रभाव से 11 फरवरी 2025 से लागू हो गए हैं।","नियम 8, 37 और नियम 38 का खंड (ii) 1 अप्रैल 2025 से लागू किए जाएंगे।","कारोबारियों और सलाहकारों को सही समय पर नियमों का पालन करने के लिए इन तारीखों पर ध्यान देना चाहिए।"],"whoIsAffected":"This affects GST-registered businesses, traders, and tax practitioners subject to the amended CGST rules."},{"id":"cdbec82181fd7f6d4ccd","sourceId":"gstc-cgst-circular","authority":"GST Council","category":"CGST Circular","topics":["gst"],"number":"248/05/2025-GST","title":"Various issues related to availment of benefit of Section 128A of the CGST Act, 2017","issuedOn":"2025-03-27","pdfUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-04/circular-no-248-05-2025.pdf","pdfUrlHindi":null,"listingUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/cgst-circulars","sortDate":"2025-03-27","firstSeenOn":"2026-11-13","status":"ready","plainTitle":"Clarifications on GST Interest and Penalty Waiver Under Section 128A","summaryEn":["Taxpayers who paid their tax demands through GSTR-3B instead of DRC-03 before 1 November 2024 can still get interest and penalty waiver under Section 128A, subject to verification.","Any payments made on or after 1 November 2024 must strictly follow the payment modes prescribed under Rule 164.","If a demand order spans both eligible years (FY 2017-18 to 2019-20) and outside years, taxpayers can pay tax only for the eligible period and file Form SPL-01 or SPL-02.","Taxpayers can withdraw their appeal solely for the Section 128A period, while the appellate authority or tribunal will proceed to decide the appeal for the remaining years."],"summaryHi":["जिन करदाताओं ने 1 नवंबर 2024 से पहले DRC-03 के बजाय GSTR-3B से टैक्स भरा था, वे भी धारा 128A के तहत ब्याज और पेनल्टी माफी पाने के हकदार हैं (अधिकारी द्वारा जांच के अधीन)।","1 नवंबर 2024 को या उसके बाद टैक्स चुकाने वाले करदाताओं को नियम 164 के तहत निर्धारित तरीकों से ही भुगतान करना अनिवार्य होगा।","यदि कोई टैक्स नोटिस या आदेश धारा 128A की अवधि (वित्त वर्ष 2017-18 से 2019-20) और अन्य वर्षों दोनों से जुड़ा है, तो केवल पात्र अवधि का टैक्स भरकर FORM SPL-01 या SPL-02 दाखिल किया जा सकता है।","करदाता केवल धारा 128A वाली अवधि के लिए अपनी अपील वापस ले सकते हैं, जबकि बाकी बची अवधि के लिए अपील पर प्राधिकरण अलग से फैसला देगा।"],"whoIsAffected":"This circular affects GST-registered taxpayers facing Section 73 demand notices or orders for FY 2017-18 to FY 2019-20 who want to claim waiver of interest and penalty."},{"id":"42176733a90b7e478c36","sourceId":"gstc-cgst-circular","authority":"GST Council","category":"CGST Circular","topics":["gst"],"number":"247/04/2025-GST","title":"Clarification regarding GST rates & classification (goods) based on the recommendations of the GST Council in its 55th meeting held on 21st December, 2024, at Jaisalmer.","issuedOn":"2025-02-14","pdfUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-04/circular-no-247-04-2025.pdf","pdfUrlHindi":null,"listingUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/cgst-circulars","sortDate":"2025-02-14","firstSeenOn":"2026-11-13","status":"pending"},{"id":"b708601414e48956fc9a","sourceId":"gstc-cgst-circular","authority":"GST Council","category":"CGST Circular","topics":["gst"],"number":"246/03/2025-GST","title":"Clarification on applicability of late fee for delay in furnishing of FORM GSTR-9C","issuedOn":"2025-01-30","pdfUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/sites/default/files/2025-01/cir-cgst-246-03-2025.pdf","pdfUrlHindi":null,"listingUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil.gov.in/cgst-circulars","sortDate":"2025-01-30","firstSeenOn":"2026-11-13","status":"pending"},{"id":"14d3dc7c5a7e64a7b183","sourceId":"gstc-cgst-circular","authority":"GST Council","category":"CGST Circular","topics":["gst"],"number":"245/02/2025-GST","title":"Clarifications regarding applicability of GST on certain services.","issuedOn":"2025-01-28","pdfUrl":"https://www.gstcouncil